  config edit-changed ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. A save refused: the file changed$
# since hardn read it. Nothing is saved.$
$
# Edit a setting ###############################################$
$
   1) username             george$
   2) sshKeys              1 key$
   3) sshPort              2222$
   4) disableRootSSH       true$
   5) enableUfwSshPolicy   true$
   6) configureDns         true$
   7) syslogServers        None$
   8) ntpServers           None$
   9) kernel               false$
  10) confirmTimeout       3m$
  11) checkReleases        false$
  12) enableAutoUpdates    true$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-12 or q]: $
$
# sshPort ######################################################$
$
  Enter SSH port [2222] [0 or q]: $
$
